Project FarmerPlatform {
  database_type: "MongoDB"
  Note: '''
    ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
    ║   FARMER ONE STOP SOLUTION — Enterprise Schema v4.0 (FINAL)     ║
    ║   Geo-intelligent | AI-enabled | Auditable | Fraud-aware         ║
    ║   Community + Chat + Blog | Full Disease Intelligence            ║
    ║   Crowdfunding with Escrow | Dynamic Permissions                 ║
    ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

    ┌─ SOFT-DELETE RULE ──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ All entity tables carry:                                        │
    │   is_deleted boolean  [default: false]                          │
    │   deleted_at datetime [null]                                    │
    │   deleted_by ObjectId [null]                                    │
    │ Hard-delete is NEVER done on any entity.                        │
    │ Cascade: deleting a community soft-deletes posts/rooms.         │
    │ Unique indexes on active rows only (is_deleted=false).          │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ AUDIT RULE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ Every state-mutating action on financial / disease / moderation │
    │ entities writes one row to audit_logs.                          │
    │ Entity types: USER|LOAN|PLEDGE|DISEASE_REPORT|LISTING|ORDER     │
    │               MILESTONE|REPAYMENT|ALERT|SCHEME|BLOG|COMMUNITY   │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ GEO RULE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ Primary 2dsphere indexes (hot path only):                       │
    │   users.primary_(lat,lng)  → alert fan-out                     │
    │   locations.(lat,lng)       → "find near me" base              │
    │   marketplace_listings.(lat,lng) → buyer radius search         │
    │   disease_reports.(lat,lng) → outbreak heatmap                 │
    │   labor_profiles.(lat,lng)  → find labor near farm             │
    │   communities.(center_lat,lng) → community discovery           │
    │   blogs.(lat,lng)           → field-report geo search          │
    │ Derived geo (state/district) stored only for aggregation.       │
    │ App MUST validate district belongs to state on write.           │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ DENORM RULE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ district_id, crop_name, farmer_name are duplicated on           │
    │ high-read tables to eliminate $lookup on hot paths.             │
    │ Denormed strings are SNAPSHOTS — they do not update on rename.  │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ DISEASE INTELLIGENCE RULE ─────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ predicted_disease (string) = AI snapshot at detection time.     │
    │ disease_catalog_id (ref)   = canonical post-review link.        │
    │ ai_confidence_level (enum) = derived from confidence_score:     │
    │   < 0.5 → LOW,  0.5–0.8 → MEDIUM,  > 0.8 → HIGH               │
    │ Outbreak pipeline: disease_aggregates_daily is precomputed      │
    │ nightly rollup. Live scan only for last 24 h window.            │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ CROWDFUNDING ESCROW RULE ──────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ Money flow: pledge created (HELD) →                             │
    │             milestone completed → funds RELEASED to farmer      │
    │             loan rejected/expired → pledge REFUNDED             │
    │ loan_fund_wallet tracks running balance per loan.               │
    │ loan_repayment_distributions allocates each repayment row       │
    │ back to original pledgers proportionally.                       │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ SHARD KEY STRATEGY ────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ users                → hashed _id                               │
    │ disease_reports      → hashed district_id                       │
    │ marketplace_listings → hashed district_id                       │
    │ community_chat_messages → hashed room_id                        │
    │ notifications        → hashed user_id                           │
    │ weather_snapshots    → hashed land_id                           │
    │ audit_logs           → hashed entity_id                         │
    │ user_events          → hashed user_id                           │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

    ┌─ TTL / ARCHIVE STRATEGY ────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ weather_snapshots    → TTL 90 days on recorded_at               │
    │ community_chat_messages → TTL 365 days (archive to cold store)  │
    │ user_events          → TTL 180 days on created_at               │
    │ notifications        → TTL 60 days on created_at                │
    │ rate_limit_logs      → TTL 24 hours on window_start             │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  '''
}

//////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// ███████╗███╗   ██╗██╗   ██╗███╗   ███╗███████╗
// ██╔════╝████╗  ██║██║   ██║████╗ ████║██╔════╝
// █████╗  ██╔██╗ ██║██║   ██║██╔████╔██║███████╗
// ██╔══╝  ██║╚██╗██║██║   ██║██║╚██╔╝██║╚════██║
// ███████╗██║ ╚████║╚██████╔╝██║ ╚═╝ ██║███████║
// ╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═══╝ ╚═════╝ ╚═╝     ╚═╝╚══════╝
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////

